## 🙏 A Great Thank You to PCBWay for Sponsoring RF Skid!

I'd like to extend a huge thanks to PCBWay for sponsoring the fabrication and PCBA (printed circuit board assembly) for my RF Skid project, including free shipping! 🎉❤️

PCBWay is a great resource and company for makers, engineers, hobbyists, and hardware developers alike, providing PCB fabrication and assembly services to help bring ideas, prototypes, and custom electronics designs to life.

From custom PCB fabrication to fully assembled boards, PCBWay makes the process for developing electronics projects much more accessible. Whether it's developing a small project prototype, embedded system, or a more complex hardware project, a reliable manufacturing partner can make a huge difference.

For RF Skid, the sponsorship allows bringing my custom hardware design one step closer to being reality. The project puts together Bruce Firmware, NRF24, CC1101, and infrared (IR) functionality to create a platform for RF experimentation, wireless protocol research, and authorized security testing. Having access to professionally made and assembled PCBs is a great support to help a project like this go from a design on screen to a physical device that's being used.

A big thanks goes to PCBWay for supporting the build and helping get the PCB and PCBA process going, with the added benefit of free shipping! Your support makes a big difference and allows independent makers like me to continue developing and testing exciting hardware projects. 🚀

